(6230722, 921250, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  Light is remarkable, especially with the natural and cooler backlighting.  Love that the guy is not quite looking at camera; that''s a master touch.  9.  Thank you.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  Light is remarkable, especially with the natural and cooler backlighting.  Love that the guy is not quite looking at camera; that''s a master touch.  9.  Thank you.', '2010-11-23 04:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230725, 921226, 30364, '<td valign="top">I am loving looking at the beautiful artifacts you''ve arranged here.  I almost never can like a set up photograph, and yet I love this one.  Could be the fact that I remember 1963 and that news very well.  It''s a very enjoyable and well executed image.  9.  Thank you.</td>', 'I am loving looking at the beautiful artifacts you''ve arranged here.  I almost never can like a set up photograph, and yet I love this one.  Could be the fact that I remember 1963 and that news very well.  It''s a very enjoyable and well executed image.  9.  Thank you.', '2010-11-23 04:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230727, 921407, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes.  Very good and different too. Thank you.</td>', 'Yes.  Very good and different too. Thank you.', '2010-11-23 04:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230729, 920893, 30364, '<td valign="top">In terms of the spirit of the challenge, this is perhaps the best photograph.  It''s not quite my personal favourite, but that''s my fault and not yours because your photograph is just terrific.  You certainly should get a ribbon.  9.  Congratulations, and thank you.</td>', 'In terms of the spirit of the challenge, this is perhaps the best photograph.  It''s not quite my personal favourite, but that''s my fault and not yours because your photograph is just terrific.  You certainly should get a ribbon.  9.  Congratulations, and thank you.', '2010-11-23 04:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230732, 921060, 30364, '<td valign="top">A most convincing vintage feel, without having used any of those phony ''vintage'' filters, actions and other gimmicks.   Could be that''s a big part of why it''s so apparently authentic ... it <i>feels </i>real!  Thank you.</td>', 'A most convincing vintage feel, without having used any of those phony ''vintage'' filters, actions and other gimmicks.   Could be that''s a big part of why it''s so apparently authentic ... it feels real!  Thank you.', '2010-11-23 04:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230734, 920938, 30364, '<td valign="top">Something arresting about this; it''s better &amp; better the longer I look.  The small portrait above her shoulder is something to do with it.  So''s the right-left split of the tones.  And of course she is herself pretty nasty-nice too.  Freckles but a fukkoff gaze.  My favourite haircut.  Also my favourite image in this challenge.  10.    Thank you.</td>', 'Something arresting about this; it''s better & better the longer I look.  The small portrait above her shoulder is something to do with it.  So''s the right-left split of the tones.  And of course she is herself pretty nasty-nice too.  Freckles but a fukkoff gaze.  My favourite haircut.  Also my favourite image in this challenge.  10.    Thank you.', '2010-11-23 04:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230738, 921225, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Nice treatment in processing, but I''d have gone a bit darker with the tones to give it some more mood and range and pull out some more golden tones, as it seems a tad too bright. Not voting, just commenting on the ones that jump out. Great idea. Well done.</td>', 'Great composition. Nice treatment in processing, but I''d have gone a bit darker with the tones to give it some more mood and range and pull out some more golden tones, as it seems a tad too bright. Not voting, just commenting on the ones that jump out. Great idea. Well done.', '2010-11-23 05:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230739, 921176, 108069, '<td valign="top">Amazingly well done. It truly is right out of the 70s. The decor fits perfectly, her hair is perfect, and the processing is, well, perfect. Excellent work for this challenge.</td>', 'Amazingly well done. It truly is right out of the 70s. The decor fits perfectly, her hair is perfect, and the processing is, well, perfect. Excellent work for this challenge.', '2010-11-23 05:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230741, 921246, 119012, '<td valign="top">not sure if its intentional but way too dark.</td>', 'not sure if its intentional but way too dark.', '2010-11-23 06:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230756, 921461, 113156, '<td valign="top">like the way you filled the frame here, the leaf is a nice extra, good shot.</td>', 'like the way you filled the frame here, the leaf is a nice extra, good shot.', '2010-11-23 07:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230768, 920222, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Looks like a restored photo of an old image. Excellent photo in its own right, but more so certainly for this challenge. I bet there''s some great greens and blues in the color version as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great shot. Looks like a restored photo of an old image. Excellent photo in its own right, but more so certainly for this challenge. I bet there''s some great greens and blues in the color version as well. Nicely done.', '2010-11-23 08:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230769, 921246, 85430, '<td valign="top">The black adds mood to the photo, but i think it''s a little too much. A little faint lighting may have made this image way better.</td>', 'The black adds mood to the photo, but i think it''s a little too much. A little faint lighting may have made this image way better.', '2010-11-23 08:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230777, 921193, 85430, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. The couch justifies the landscape orientation of this well-executed portrait.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. The couch justifies the landscape orientation of this well-executed portrait.', '2010-11-23 08:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230787, 921277, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  I love the soft blur to make our thoughts waft away to former times.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  I love the soft blur to make our thoughts waft away to former times.', '2010-11-23 08:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230788, 920938, 15711, '<td valign="top">God that is just GREAT!!!!</td>', 'God that is just GREAT!!!!', '2010-11-23 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230789, 921307, 85430, '<td valign="top">the bounced light from the backdrop is a bit distracting, but the overall composition, the placement of the objects is nicely done.</td>', 'the bounced light from the backdrop is a bit distracting, but the overall composition, the placement of the objects is nicely done.', '2010-11-23 08:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230790, 921203, 85430, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the color tone.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the color tone.', '2010-11-23 08:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230791, 921428, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this.  It''s subtle and almost melancholy.</td>', 'I love this.  It''s subtle and almost melancholy.', '2010-11-23 08:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
