(6230800, 921193, 108069, '<td valign="top">Extremely well lit, and excellent composition. Framing is perfect. Nice tones and a perfect scene for the challenge. Excellent.</td>', 'Extremely well lit, and excellent composition. Framing is perfect. Nice tones and a perfect scene for the challenge. Excellent.', '2010-11-23 08:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230801, 921227, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and great entry. Certainly another time. Nice sharp photo with simple and perfect processing. Well done.</td>', 'Clever idea and great entry. Certainly another time. Nice sharp photo with simple and perfect processing. Well done.', '2010-11-23 09:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230803, 921370, 108069, '<td valign="top">Really nice still life. Great tones and processing, nice composition. Great lighting. Well done.</td>', 'Really nice still life. Great tones and processing, nice composition. Great lighting. Well done.', '2010-11-23 09:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230804, 921462, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Certainly brings back some memories.</td>', 'Clever idea. Certainly brings back some memories.', '2010-11-23 09:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230832, 920866, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent work here. Truly reminiscent of a classic vision from a different era. All the technicals are perfect, so I won''t list them. Congrats.</td>', 'Excellent work here. Truly reminiscent of a classic vision from a different era. All the technicals are perfect, so I won''t list them. Congrats.', '2010-11-23 09:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230840, 921410, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I also life in wine country but our vines are bare and our skies are gray and our clouds are emptying their water like our eyes do on our cheeks. Sorry. The weather and light and conditions are downright miserable here and I had no chance at a shot like this. I hope it does well.</td>', 'Nice shot. I also life in wine country but our vines are bare and our skies are gray and our clouds are emptying their water like our eyes do on our cheeks. Sorry. The weather and light and conditions are downright miserable here and I had no chance at a shot like this. I hope it does well.', '2010-11-23 09:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230846, 921048, 108069, '<td valign="top">Consistent branding, I''ll give them that. Clever idea and well executed. Nice work.</td>', 'Consistent branding, I''ll give them that. Clever idea and well executed. Nice work.', '2010-11-23 09:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230848, 920185, 108069, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting (and doesn''t matter anyway, as a perceived DQ is not supposed to impact voting), but I hope you shot this through something or the texture police will come crashing down on you.<br/> <br/>Great idea, though.</td>', 'I''m not voting (and doesn''t matter anyway, as a perceived DQ is not supposed to impact voting), but I hope you shot this through something or the texture police will come crashing down on you. Great idea, though.', '2010-11-23 09:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230849, 921200, 108069, '<td valign="top">Super shot. Processed perfectly. I''m not a fan of vignetting but it seems to work well here, almost mimicking the wagon wheel. Crisp, great tones, certainly a vintage ride. Lighting worked out perfectly. The outhouse is almost too modern, but no complaints. Great entry.</td>', 'Super shot. Processed perfectly. I''m not a fan of vignetting but it seems to work well here, almost mimicking the wagon wheel. Crisp, great tones, certainly a vintage ride. Lighting worked out perfectly. The outhouse is almost too modern, but no complaints. Great entry.', '2010-11-23 09:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230851, 921100, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. Excellent lighting, tones, focal depth, all of it. Very classy work. Nice job.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. Excellent lighting, tones, focal depth, all of it. Very classy work. Nice job.', '2010-11-23 09:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230857, 921060, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great scene. Truly would mistake it for a relic if I hadn''t known. Excellent work.</td>', 'Wow. Great scene. Truly would mistake it for a relic if I hadn''t known. Excellent work.', '2010-11-23 10:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230866, 921206, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I do have some criticisms though. I''m not voting, just popping around making comments. The wheel needs to be sharp. It dominates the frame and since it''s out of focus it hurts the entire image. With the wheel in focus and a small aperture to maintain clarity in the river, this photo suddenly jumps from a good photo to an excellent scene.<br/> <br/>I see the rock just beyond the hub is crystal sharp and likely where auto focus pinpointed. So either that was simply the center of the frame or you missed focusing on the hub by the smallest of margins. <br/> <br/>The grate detracts a little as well, and maybe some creative composition could have helped a bit but it''s not a big deal.<br/> <br/>Overall a well spotted scene and a ton of potential, just slightly different execution. Of course I''m not a good photographer, so read this at your own risk.</td>', 'Great idea. I do have some criticisms though. I''m not voting, just popping around making comments. The wheel needs to be sharp. It dominates the frame and since it''s out of focus it hurts the entire image. With the wheel in focus and a small aperture to maintain clarity in the river, this photo suddenly jumps from a good photo to an excellent scene. I see the rock just beyond the hub is crystal sharp and likely where auto focus pinpointed. So either that was simply the center of the frame or you missed focusing on the hub by the smallest of margins.  The grate detracts a little as well, and maybe some creative composition could have helped a bit but it''s not a big deal. Overall a well spotted scene and a ton of potential, just slightly different execution. Of course I''m not a good photographer, so read this at your own risk.', '2010-11-23 10:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230897, 920222, 62989, '<td valign="top">There''s a double vintage thi going on here I think - the building itself but also the image has a 1940s 50s picture postcard feel - I would like it even better if it had a faint wash of colour like an old postcard</td>', 'There''s a double vintage thi going on here I think - the building itself but also the image has a 1940s 50s picture postcard feel - I would like it even better if it had a faint wash of colour like an old postcard', '2010-11-23 11:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
