(6230941, 921184, 92577, '<td valign="top">Before I got to your shot I put ''Ooh La La'' as my comment on another shot. I wonder if you can pick it out?<br/>I like yours just as well so I''ll give you the same score.<br/>(the bar stool may be a bit of an anachronism but I barely noticed it)</td>', 'Before I got to your shot I put ''Ooh La La'' as my comment on another shot. I wonder if you can pick it out?I like yours just as well so I''ll give you the same score.(the bar stool may be a bit of an anachronism but I barely noticed it)', '2010-11-23 12:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
