(6230951, 921342, 63244, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the sharpness of the shot. IMHO, this would have looked more vintage with a good black and white treatment in the style of Clark Gable, Marlena Dietrich, etc. Sepia isn''t necessarily a "half to" for vintage, but it''s one of many treatments that can be used. To me, this would have appeared more vintage in black and white. I like the shot quite well and Sepia will not lose you points! :)<br/>Love the hat!!!!</td>', 'I love the idea and the sharpness of the shot. IMHO, this would have looked more vintage with a good black and white treatment in the style of Clark Gable, Marlena Dietrich, etc. Sepia isn''t necessarily a "half to" for vintage, but it''s one of many treatments that can be used. To me, this would have appeared more vintage in black and white. I like the shot quite well and Sepia will not lose you points! :)Love the hat!!!!', '2010-11-23 12:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230954, 920739, 63244, '<td valign="top">Aw, the poor dial is missing. We had many of these, lol. Very simple, very crisp shot. Nicely done. Cannot tell if you subtly desaturated the shot or if the colors are naturally muted, but this works quite nicely. Well done.</td>', 'Aw, the poor dial is missing. We had many of these, lol. Very simple, very crisp shot. Nicely done. Cannot tell if you subtly desaturated the shot or if the colors are naturally muted, but this works quite nicely. Well done.', '2010-11-23 12:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6230956, 920910, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice old time feel and gritty look.</td>', 'Nice old time feel and gritty look.', '2010-11-23 12:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
