(6231186, 920939, 122131, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful portrait. You''ve framed it perfectly, and made it look very authentic.<br/>However, the image is very soft -- whilst it''s desirable in fashion portraits, I think, taking into consideration the harsh sun of the desert, the wrinkles on the man, this would benefit from spot-on focus, and a more obvious contrast to accentuate on the desert sun, and the wrinkles.<br/>As it is, I''ll give it a 6.</td>', 'This is a very powerful portrait. You''ve framed it perfectly, and made it look very authentic.However, the image is very soft -- whilst it''s desirable in fashion portraits, I think, taking into consideration the harsh sun of the desert, the wrinkles on the man, this would benefit from spot-on focus, and a more obvious contrast to accentuate on the desert sun, and the wrinkles.As it is, I''ll give it a 6.', '2010-11-23 18:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
