(6231386, 920938, 28882, '<td valign="top">this has a vintage feel.  i like the face of the figure.   the little picture in the corner really adds to this shot.</td>', 'this has a vintage feel.  i like the face of the figure.   the little picture in the corner really adds to this shot.', '2010-11-23 22:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231392, 921124, 112739, '<td valign="top">I love California red wine, some of the best around. I think I would like to see some wine in the glass though. Not really inviting with an empty glass. But all in all an excellent image. Processed expertly. 8</td>', 'I love California red wine, some of the best around. I think I would like to see some wine in the glass though. Not really inviting with an empty glass. But all in all an excellent image. Processed expertly. 8', '2010-11-23 22:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231393, 921446, 112739, '<td valign="top">They don''t make em like this anymore! I grew up about 40 miles from Rockford IL! Very cool shot. A tad bit OOF though. Might have used a smaller aperture. 7</td>', 'They don''t make em like this anymore! I grew up about 40 miles from Rockford IL! Very cool shot. A tad bit OOF though. Might have used a smaller aperture. 7', '2010-11-23 22:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231394, 921261, 112739, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot...photo of photos. Very cool photos! I might have placed them using a different background, maybe a light solid color since the wall is a bit distracting. Good processing. 6</td>', 'Interesting shot...photo of photos. Very cool photos! I might have placed them using a different background, maybe a light solid color since the wall is a bit distracting. Good processing. 6', '2010-11-23 22:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231395, 921284, 112739, '<td valign="top">Nice work. I do know that the majority of "old time" subjects were told to look into space most of the time. But this pose seems to work good although it seems the subject is leaning backward in an awkward manner. The processing rocks, love the intentional OOF and the grain. Great work. 7</td>', 'Nice work. I do know that the majority of "old time" subjects were told to look into space most of the time. But this pose seems to work good although it seems the subject is leaning backward in an awkward manner. The processing rocks, love the intentional OOF and the grain. Great work. 7', '2010-11-23 22:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231397, 920817, 112739, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could work better with much more wider view. There is just a little too much to look at. My eye can''t seem to settle on anyone thing. The processing works well.</td>', 'I think this shot could work better with much more wider view. There is just a little too much to look at. My eye can''t seem to settle on anyone thing. The processing works well.', '2010-11-23 22:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231401, 921105, 112739, '<td valign="top">Original owners manual. Very cool.</td>', 'Original owners manual. Very cool.', '2010-11-23 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231413, 921179, 112739, '<td valign="top">Ahh...one eye Mary. What a spooky and disturbing image. Not sure if it should be, but it sure feels it. Not sure about vintage though. Maybe old and beat up.</td>', 'Ahh...one eye Mary. What a spooky and disturbing image. Not sure if it should be, but it sure feels it. Not sure about vintage though. Maybe old and beat up.', '2010-11-23 22:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231426, 921452, 112739, '<td valign="top">I thing this could have been a very good shot. The grapes a all OOF. It''s good that the vines are, but the grapes should be in focus. Don''t like the vignette, a bit strong for the image.</td>', 'I thing this could have been a very good shot. The grapes a all OOF. It''s good that the vines are, but the grapes should be in focus. Don''t like the vignette, a bit strong for the image.', '2010-11-23 22:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231485, 920633, 117534, '<td valign="top">Very Nice shot, I over looked this on my first vote thru. but a good 8 and if you send me a bottle I''ll give u a 10</td>', 'Very Nice shot, I over looked this on my first vote thru. but a good 8 and if you send me a bottle I''ll give u a 10', '2010-11-23 23:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
