(6231678, 921399, 94241, '<td valign="top">I love the grainy, mottled, yellow-green effect.  But my eyes keep going to that blurry spot in the upper-right.  I wish you''d added some grain over top of it.</td>', 'I love the grainy, mottled, yellow-green effect.  But my eyes keep going to that blurry spot in the upper-right.  I wish you''d added some grain over top of it.', '2010-11-24 00:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231692, 921102, 94241, '<td valign="top">I love the idea.  Did you try using a polarizer to cut the glare from the window?  I think the glare is just a little too dominating.</td>', 'I love the idea.  Did you try using a polarizer to cut the glare from the window?  I think the glare is just a little too dominating.', '2010-11-24 00:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231716, 921428, 94241, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot and coloring.  I think the composition feels a tiny bit heavy on the top-left though.  I''d shave a little bit off either the right or the bottom edge of the frame.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot and coloring.  I think the composition feels a tiny bit heavy on the top-left though.  I''d shave a little bit off either the right or the bottom edge of the frame.', '2010-11-24 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231884, 921428, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Exudes an air of nostalgia. You lift the veil of the past with this image to give us a glimpse of a memory arrested for a brief and fleeting moment in time. The horse has been very creatively placed to exact the maximum dramatic effect with it''s shadow on the wall. Simple and uncluttered composition. Excellent processing to create just the right ambiance and mood with the tones, textures and colors.</td>', 'Lovely. Exudes an air of nostalgia. You lift the veil of the past with this image to give us a glimpse of a memory arrested for a brief and fleeting moment in time. The horse has been very creatively placed to exact the maximum dramatic effect with it''s shadow on the wall. Simple and uncluttered composition. Excellent processing to create just the right ambiance and mood with the tones, textures and colors.', '2010-11-24 06:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231887, 920739, 64086, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and mood.</td>', 'Beautiful light and mood.', '2010-11-24 06:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231907, 921041, 14042, '<td valign="top">Good work on the lighting, the darkening of the left balances the highlights to the right. It''s a good start, but the mistake is to have two brands next to each other, whereby one (the handle) protrudes out closer to the camera, but the camera focuses on the other (business end).</td>', 'Good work on the lighting, the darkening of the left balances the highlights to the right. It''s a good start, but the mistake is to have two brands next to each other, whereby one (the handle) protrudes out closer to the camera, but the camera focuses on the other (business end).', '2010-11-24 06:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231908, 921407, 14042, '<td valign="top">This is superfine. Great texture, colors are stinky and real (complement!), but somewhat poor framing on the left. Also, did you try without flash?</td>', 'This is superfine. Great texture, colors are stinky and real (complement!), but somewhat poor framing on the left. Also, did you try without flash?', '2010-11-24 06:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231909, 921372, 14042, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Wonder why you need all that black space around the sides/top.</td>', 'Sweet! Wonder why you need all that black space around the sides/top.', '2010-11-24 06:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231914, 921453, 14042, '<td valign="top">In my youth (2003) I could have liked your framing. Zoomed in, messiness approximating randomness, and good faded colors and shadows. The 2010 me thinks, This isn''t how (s)he found these post cards. The feeling you want to convey is, Let me show you these old things I have. This isn''t how you''d show us your postcards.</td>', 'In my youth (2003) I could have liked your framing. Zoomed in, messiness approximating randomness, and good faded colors and shadows. The 2010 me thinks, This isn''t how (s)he found these post cards. The feeling you want to convey is, Let me show you these old things I have. This isn''t how you''d show us your postcards.', '2010-11-24 06:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6231915, 920815, 14042, '<td valign="top">Ha! This is funny, focused and honest. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Ha! This is funny, focused and honest. I like it a lot.', '2010-11-24 06:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
