(6232744, 921452, 96751, '<td valign="top">A very lovely image.  I think the centered composition weakens it a little - I see the bunch just a bit more off-center.</td>', 'A very lovely image.  I think the centered composition weakens it a little - I see the bunch just a bit more off-center.', '2010-11-25 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232746, 921203, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  The first image to capture the essence of "vintage", and not just a picture of an old thing.  Killer wallpaper, and the tones are luscious.  I don''t know why it looks "vintage", but it does.</td>', 'Fabulous.  The first image to capture the essence of "vintage", and not just a picture of an old thing.  Killer wallpaper, and the tones are luscious.  I don''t know why it looks "vintage", but it does.', '2010-11-25 01:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232747, 921067, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lots of planning went into this.  And I want that jacket you''re wearing.</td>', 'Lots of planning went into this.  And I want that jacket you''re wearing.', '2010-11-25 01:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232748, 920938, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sheesh!  Even the manikins have attitude!  Very appealing image, the soft focus and shallow dof really work well, and convey a sense of time and place.</td>', 'Sheesh!  Even the manikins have attitude!  Very appealing image, the soft focus and shallow dof really work well, and convey a sense of time and place.', '2010-11-25 01:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232749, 921180, 96751, '<td valign="top">This conveys a sense of melancholy and nostalgia more than vintage, but it is a stunning image.  The lighting is splendid, the desat is perfect, and the bird, well - the cherry on the icing on the cake.</td>', 'This conveys a sense of melancholy and nostalgia more than vintage, but it is a stunning image.  The lighting is splendid, the desat is perfect, and the bird, well - the cherry on the icing on the cake.', '2010-11-25 01:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
