(6232757, 921029, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific portrait.  I love everything about it (except the border).  The pov is very interesting and unique, and really conveys a sense that this is a lone wolf, unaccustomed to newfangled flashy thingies.</td>', 'This is a terrific portrait.  I love everything about it (except the border).  The pov is very interesting and unique, and really conveys a sense that this is a lone wolf, unaccustomed to newfangled flashy thingies.', '2010-11-25 01:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
