(6232760, 921238, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think that if there ever were wormholes, our first glimpses through them would look like this.  I feel like I am traveling back in time when I look at this picture, and memories and emotions rush back at me.</td>', 'I think that if there ever were wormholes, our first glimpses through them would look like this.  I feel like I am traveling back in time when I look at this picture, and memories and emotions rush back at me.', '2010-11-25 01:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232762, 921277, 96751, '<td valign="top">This could easily be an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5112" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ursula</a> creation.  There is a delicacy in both the focus and color palate that is truly appealing.</td>', 'This could easily be an  ursula creation.  There is a delicacy in both the focus and color palate that is truly appealing.', '2010-11-25 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232767, 920586, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so very good.  The pov is inspired, and the desat is gorgeous.  I also like the high contrast, which gives it that "memory" look.  I can imagine him saying "do NOT cross that line".  A minor nit - I''d have cloned out that dark leaf on the bottom.  It''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'This is so very good.  The pov is inspired, and the desat is gorgeous.  I also like the high contrast, which gives it that "memory" look.  I can imagine him saying "do NOT cross that line".  A minor nit - I''d have cloned out that dark leaf on the bottom.  It''s a bit distracting.', '2010-11-25 01:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232769, 921307, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and elements, but a bit soft on the focus.</td>', 'Nice composition and elements, but a bit soft on the focus.', '2010-11-25 01:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232770, 921461, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice auto detail.</td>', 'Nice auto detail.', '2010-11-25 01:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232771, 920868, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about "vintage", but this is so well processed - a case where the right pp''ing can turn anything into art.</td>', 'I don''t know about "vintage", but this is so well processed - a case where the right pp''ing can turn anything into art.', '2010-11-25 01:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232772, 921428, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, oh, OH!!!!!!!!  This is my pick for the blue.  Both vintagey AND conceptual.  The colors, the lighting, the SHADOW!!!!  LOVE it.  Inspired choice to show us the business end of the horsey.</td>', 'Oh, oh, OH!!!!!!!!  This is my pick for the blue.  Both vintagey AND conceptual.  The colors, the lighting, the SHADOW!!!!  LOVE it.  Inspired choice to show us the business end of the horsey.', '2010-11-25 01:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232773, 921041, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract.</td>', 'Lovely abstract.', '2010-11-25 01:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232774, 921462, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  i love these lamps.</td>', 'LOL!  i love these lamps.', '2010-11-25 01:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232775, 921352, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The monochrome is PERFECT and the bokeh is delicate and gorgeous.  My only nit is the dangling portion of the web.  I don''t know why it looks gross while the rest of it is marvelous.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The monochrome is PERFECT and the bokeh is delicate and gorgeous.  My only nit is the dangling portion of the web.  I don''t know why it looks gross while the rest of it is marvelous.', '2010-11-25 01:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232776, 921399, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting pp''ing.  Hmmm.  Can''t decide if I like it, but it made me stop and comment :-)</td>', 'Interesting pp''ing.  Hmmm.  Can''t decide if I like it, but it made me stop and comment :-)', '2010-11-25 01:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232778, 921334, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, although I think a slightly skewed perspective might have been more powerful.</td>', 'This is lovely, although I think a slightly skewed perspective might have been more powerful.', '2010-11-25 01:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232779, 921398, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous image.  I love the tones, and that flare on the left really adds an interesting counterpoint.  Perhaps the balance could be improved just a bit with a little less negative space on the right.</td>', 'Fabulous image.  I love the tones, and that flare on the left really adds an interesting counterpoint.  Perhaps the balance could be improved just a bit with a little less negative space on the right.', '2010-11-25 01:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232783, 921277, 16241, '<td valign="top">lovely, perfect title</td>', 'lovely, perfect title', '2010-11-25 01:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232794, 920817, 14042, '<td valign="top">What about this says, Vintage? What does this even say? You''ve got a "subject" with her back to us, something else coming in from the left and a background that is easily, if irrelevantly, more interesting than the foreground.</td>', 'What about this says, Vintage? What does this even say? You''ve got a "subject" with her back to us, something else coming in from the left and a background that is easily, if irrelevantly, more interesting than the foreground.', '2010-11-25 02:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232797, 921370, 14042, '<td valign="top">Well it''s vintage -- cigars, rye jug, um- apples. It''s grainy, that''s the texture of vintage. It''s centered. I never know what to say on photos like these: I could leave you with the above, or I could tell you grow beyond that picture you''ve probably seen before in an ad or catalog. The one you''re trying to imitate here. What would a more interesting perspective do for a photo like this? From an elevated position, perhaps, so you could really place these items out of the reach of a departing soul.<br/> <br/>Does this make any sense?</td>', 'Well it''s vintage -- cigars, rye jug, um- apples. It''s grainy, that''s the texture of vintage. It''s centered. I never know what to say on photos like these: I could leave you with the above, or I could tell you grow beyond that picture you''ve probably seen before in an ad or catalog. The one you''re trying to imitate here. What would a more interesting perspective do for a photo like this? From an elevated position, perhaps, so you could really place these items out of the reach of a departing soul. Does this make any sense?', '2010-11-25 02:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232798, 921134, 14042, '<td valign="top">Quite pleasant. What you did here I hope was intentional, because it is superb: you placed the tracks diagonally across the frame. It''s refreshing, because many photos of train tracks are the Ansel Adams-esqe long shot of train tracks disappearing into the horizon.</td>', 'Quite pleasant. What you did here I hope was intentional, because it is superb: you placed the tracks diagonally across the frame. It''s refreshing, because many photos of train tracks are the Ansel Adams-esqe long shot of train tracks disappearing into the horizon.', '2010-11-25 02:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232799, 920868, 14042, '<td valign="top">This is a step beyond simply taking a picture of a cool building and clouds, because anyone can do it. You submitted a photo with and excellent color palette. The grass is dirty and tan which leads to the orange gravel to the rusty stanchions to the graying wood and corrugated metal to the dark sky. Would it have killed you to wait a little longer for marbled black/grey in the top right corner to seep into the rest of the sky?!</td>', 'This is a step beyond simply taking a picture of a cool building and clouds, because anyone can do it. You submitted a photo with and excellent color palette. The grass is dirty and tan which leads to the orange gravel to the rusty stanchions to the graying wood and corrugated metal to the dark sky. Would it have killed you to wait a little longer for marbled black/grey in the top right corner to seep into the rest of the sky?!', '2010-11-25 02:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232800, 921227, 14042, '<td valign="top">Good penmanship certainly is vintage.</td>', 'Good penmanship certainly is vintage.', '2010-11-25 02:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232801, 921225, 14042, '<td valign="top">OIC, sepia filter = instant vintage. What was wrong with the colors, Brah?</td>', 'OIC, sepia filter = instant vintage. What was wrong with the colors, Brah?', '2010-11-25 02:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232802, 920602, 14042, '<td valign="top">No one is NOT gonna like this, so I will humbly tell you what I would have done. I would have gotten in closer to the cabin, showing no sky or snow on the mountains, and I would have used infinite focus to highlight the field, the rotted wood, the crags because this is a situation where those textures in aggregate are complex, not confusing. Congrats on taking a beautiful pic of a beautiful scene.</td>', 'No one is NOT gonna like this, so I will humbly tell you what I would have done. I would have gotten in closer to the cabin, showing no sky or snow on the mountains, and I would have used infinite focus to highlight the field, the rotted wood, the crags because this is a situation where those textures in aggregate are complex, not confusing. Congrats on taking a beautiful pic of a beautiful scene.', '2010-11-25 02:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232803, 921202, 14042, '<td valign="top">Cute. Uninteresting perspective.</td>', 'Cute. Uninteresting perspective.', '2010-11-25 02:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232804, 920894, 14042, '<td valign="top">Be prepared for criticism on this picture for the blurry wheel and clutch. But none here as I distinctly got the feeling of sitting on a tractor. I''d say more steering wheel! Take a picture from typical POV.</td>', 'Be prepared for criticism on this picture for the blurry wheel and clutch. But none here as I distinctly got the feeling of sitting on a tractor. I''d say more steering wheel! Take a picture from typical POV.', '2010-11-25 02:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232805, 921151, 14042, '<td valign="top">Yea but this is still how it looks Todayyear.</td>', 'Yea but this is still how it looks Todayyear.', '2010-11-25 02:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232806, 921280, 14042, '<td valign="top">Very nice, elegant, but you let it get away from you. How? Look at the eye on the right. Aroused, intent. Now look at the eye on the left. It''s behind the unfortunate fold in her veil.</td>', 'Very nice, elegant, but you let it get away from you. How? Look at the eye on the right. Aroused, intent. Now look at the eye on the left. It''s behind the unfortunate fold in her veil.', '2010-11-25 02:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232807, 921185, 14042, '<td valign="top">I like this, actually. It''s honest and well-focused. The background is probably terribly uninteresting, but now minerally and wet.</td>', 'I like this, actually. It''s honest and well-focused. The background is probably terribly uninteresting, but now minerally and wet.', '2010-11-25 02:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232809, 921399, 14042, '<td valign="top">This is a completely unemotional, unfocused, uninteresting photo.</td>', 'This is a completely unemotional, unfocused, uninteresting photo.', '2010-11-25 02:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232810, 920893, 14042, '<td valign="top">This is a great casual photo and has character. Not sure it''s something you enter into a photog contest, but with some work you could produce an insightful, maybe enthusiastic, set.</td>', 'This is a great casual photo and has character. Not sure it''s something you enter into a photog contest, but with some work you could produce an insightful, maybe enthusiastic, set.', '2010-11-25 02:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232811, 921276, 14042, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. Hope you didn''t have to play with the colors too much. Maybe frame it better, get in there closer.</td>', 'This is excellent. Hope you didn''t have to play with the colors too much. Maybe frame it better, get in there closer.', '2010-11-25 02:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232813, 921050, 14042, '<td valign="top">Neither vintage nor original. Tell me (us) she''s holding that rose and it wasn''t done in post.</td>', 'Neither vintage nor original. Tell me (us) she''s holding that rose and it wasn''t done in post.', '2010-11-25 03:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232814, 920540, 14042, '<td valign="top">Nice, if a bit dishonest. Heavily filtered. But the texture and framing are close to spot on. This certainly has an evident motif, and that''s important in a set.</td>', 'Nice, if a bit dishonest. Heavily filtered. But the texture and framing are close to spot on. This certainly has an evident motif, and that''s important in a set.', '2010-11-25 03:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232816, 921066, 14042, '<td valign="top">I knew I''d find you, Train-tracks-disappearing-into-the-distance.</td>', 'I knew I''d find you, Train-tracks-disappearing-into-the-distance.', '2010-11-25 03:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232817, 920652, 14042, '<td valign="top">Come on, this is a photography contest, not a place to show a cool thing you took a picure of.</td>', 'Come on, this is a photography contest, not a place to show a cool thing you took a picure of.', '2010-11-25 03:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232818, 921132, 14042, '<td valign="top">This is actually really interesting. It took me a second to understand the spatial location of everything -- in a good way. This is possibly the beginning of something iconic; maybe not vintage and maybe with a different subject, but I would encourage you to develop this setup.</td>', 'This is actually really interesting. It took me a second to understand the spatial location of everything -- in a good way. This is possibly the beginning of something iconic; maybe not vintage and maybe with a different subject, but I would encourage you to develop this setup.', '2010-11-25 03:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232821, 920293, 14042, '<td valign="top">What''s that tree doing in the upper right corner? Serve a purpose, or is it an attempt to imitate framing you saw in Nat Geo? You''ve got a great subject here, and you didn''t explore it, which is a waste of your time and talent.</td>', 'What''s that tree doing in the upper right corner? Serve a purpose, or is it an attempt to imitate framing you saw in Nat Geo? You''ve got a great subject here, and you didn''t explore it, which is a waste of your time and talent.', '2010-11-25 03:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232822, 920633, 14042, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s interesting and you chose great subject matter. Advanced Editing allows for filters, and Photoshop is a very valuable tool, but you''ve let it be the main reason your photo is cool. Why don''t you explore what shadows and perspective can do to transform this from website background to adventure photo?</td>', 'Well, it''s interesting and you chose great subject matter. Advanced Editing allows for filters, and Photoshop is a very valuable tool, but you''ve let it be the main reason your photo is cool. Why don''t you explore what shadows and perspective can do to transform this from website background to adventure photo?', '2010-11-25 03:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232824, 921397, 14042, '<td valign="top">Great great great perspective. It''s interesting, it tells a tale -- this rigging and booming is how we get closer to heaven. It keeps us afloat. It''s bigger than us. Great texture to that sky. I''ll bet if you got rid of the bow and figurehead and concentrated on the rigging you''d surprise yourself.</td>', 'Great great great perspective. It''s interesting, it tells a tale -- this rigging and booming is how we get closer to heaven. It keeps us afloat. It''s bigger than us. Great texture to that sky. I''ll bet if you got rid of the bow and figurehead and concentrated on the rigging you''d surprise yourself.', '2010-11-25 03:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232825, 921409, 14042, '<td valign="top">Thumbs up for subject matter. I would have taken this shot head on, rows and rows of old, overlapping pulp.</td>', 'Thumbs up for subject matter. I would have taken this shot head on, rows and rows of old, overlapping pulp.', '2010-11-25 03:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232827, 921449, 14042, '<td valign="top">I admire your perspective, it shows you''re trying to convey something in a new way. Photo is meh.</td>', 'I admire your perspective, it shows you''re trying to convey something in a new way. Photo is meh.', '2010-11-25 03:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232828, 921203, 14042, '<td valign="top">I like this and could see it on the inside cover of a Neil Gaiman novel, you know? Beyond the dreadful shadow from the plant, I''d call this solid subject matter, perspective and emotion.</td>', 'I like this and could see it on the inside cover of a Neil Gaiman novel, you know? Beyond the dreadful shadow from the plant, I''d call this solid subject matter, perspective and emotion.', '2010-11-25 03:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232829, 921023, 14042, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but a little too "eloquent" for my taste in vintage. No big deal.</td>', 'Very nice, but a little too "eloquent" for my taste in vintage. No big deal.', '2010-11-25 03:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232830, 920967, 14042, '<td valign="top">I like it. Not so vintage as it is noir.</td>', 'I like it. Not so vintage as it is noir.', '2010-11-25 03:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232832, 920222, 14042, '<td valign="top">What type of digital camera were you using back then?</td>', 'What type of digital camera were you using back then?', '2010-11-25 03:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232833, 920961, 14042, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but where''d her hair go? And why? Hair''s important, especially in a portrait and especially in a vintage contest.</td>', 'Beautiful, but where''d her hair go? And why? Hair''s important, especially in a portrait and especially in a vintage contest.', '2010-11-25 03:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232834, 921392, 14042, '<td valign="top">Quite brilliant. You used to rules to your advantage, interesting angle, great subject, well framed. You knew a lot was going on and you cut down the "information" for us, showing us what you wanted us to see.</td>', 'Quite brilliant. You used to rules to your advantage, interesting angle, great subject, well framed. You knew a lot was going on and you cut down the "information" for us, showing us what you wanted us to see.', '2010-11-25 03:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232835, 921029, 14042, '<td valign="top">Best photo here (so far). You know this though. You even (almost) totally framed this dude with his hat. Well done. That mustache could use a bit more focus. Actually the more I look at this, the more I wish you would have shown less shirt. Great, great perspective, looking up at this cowboy looking up. His face begs for you to get in there and show some skin cells.</td>', 'Best photo here (so far). You know this though. You even (almost) totally framed this dude with his hat. Well done. That mustache could use a bit more focus. Actually the more I look at this, the more I wish you would have shown less shirt. Great, great perspective, looking up at this cowboy looking up. His face begs for you to get in there and show some skin cells.', '2010-11-25 03:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232836, 920916, 14042, '<td valign="top">Really well done.</td>', 'Really well done.', '2010-11-25 03:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232909, 920916, 62989, '<td valign="top">Not sure about vintage but the arrangement of shapes is fascinating 7</td>', 'Not sure about vintage but the arrangement of shapes is fascinating 7', '2010-11-25 07:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232910, 921428, 108069, '<td valign="top">Creative shot. Great perspective and processing. Well done.</td>', 'Creative shot. Great perspective and processing. Well done.', '2010-11-25 07:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232911, 921407, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wow. That truly is right out of my memory bank. Our family had a few of those exact cases. And that carpet, the wall the siding, the closet doors and that dress! Have you been snooping around my grandparents'' condo in Florida? I hope this gets the appreciation it deserves.</td>', 'Wow. That truly is right out of my memory bank. Our family had a few of those exact cases. And that carpet, the wall the siding, the closet doors and that dress! Have you been snooping around my grandparents'' condo in Florida? I hope this gets the appreciation it deserves.', '2010-11-25 07:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6232913, 921134, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great processing, great tones, great scene. Love the lines of rails and nice framing. Excellent DOF. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Great processing, great tones, great scene. Love the lines of rails and nice framing. Excellent DOF. Very nice shot.', '2010-11-25 07:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
