(6233293, 921397, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Love the seagulls. I like the tones well enough, I might have gone a bit less saturation but the browns work well. A little fuzzy around the perimeter though, would like see all in focus. All in all a very good shot. 8</td>', 'Very nice capture. Love the seagulls. I like the tones well enough, I might have gone a bit less saturation but the browns work well. A little fuzzy around the perimeter though, would like see all in focus. All in all a very good shot. 8', '2010-11-25 22:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
