(6236833, 920961, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very 30''s feel with the dress/props and pose.  Your processing further adds to the vintage feel.  Good job on the challenge.</td>', 'Very 30''s feel with the dress/props and pose.  Your processing further adds to the vintage feel.  Good job on the challenge.', '2010-11-29 03:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
