(6238203, 921407, 62357, '<td valign="top">I love this, one of my top picks.  In contrast to Johanna, I think the border gives it the feel of an image from the 60s.  All the photos in my family album from that time had a white border around them, so it''s totally in keeping with the era  (for me at least!)  Woefully under rated in my opinion.</td>', 'I love this, one of my top picks.  In contrast to Johanna, I think the border gives it the feel of an image from the 60s.  All the photos in my family album from that time had a white border around them, so it''s totally in keeping with the era  (for me at least!)  Woefully under rated in my opinion.', '2010-11-30 00:55:53.000000', NULL, 0),
